{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed your heroes. Build your legacy. Face the end of the world. Again and again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen, and only a few <strong>Seeds of Life</strong> remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this roguelike card and board game adventure, each run begins with the birth of a new hero. Use your limited breeding rights to select two parents, combine their traits, and bring a new warrior into the world. Your hero\u2019s stats, gender, and genetic quirks are shaped by lineage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genetics matter but nothing beats good preparation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings in your village like the <strong>Barracks</strong>, <strong>Tavern</strong>, <strong>Gold Mine</strong>, or <strong>Ink Mine</strong> to unlock unique backgrounds for your newborns. Growing up near a certain building grants them stat bonuses from the very beginning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero embarks on a dangerous journey across eight distinct regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every region features a unique atmosphere, enemies, and a randomly generated board based on a set number of turns. Roll the dice to move across tiles, encountering traps, treasure, events, and enemies as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The path is full of thorns.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face strange encounters, survive odd events, and fight bizarre creatures. You can return to the village with your loot and preserve your bloodline or risk another turn for greater rewards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true hero knows when to retreat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you return home before dying, your hero is added to the ancestral pool. That means your next child might be their child\u2026 or grandchild. And every generation is born a little stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve your legacy across generations, and inch closer to victory with every run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strengthen your bloodline and reach the ancient power waiting at the world\u2019s edge?Or will your Seeds of Life run out\u00a0 one by one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Dark Fantasy World</strong><br>An atmospheric 2D universe crafted with detailed, hand-painted visuals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloodline-Based Hero Creation</strong><br>Merge ancestors, pass on traits, and create stronger heroes with each generation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Village &amp; Building System</strong><br>Construct structures like Barracks, Tavern, and Mines to grant unique backgrounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice-Based Exploration</strong><br>Progress through a randomly generated board each turn by rolling dice.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Card Combat</strong><br>Play tactical cards, dodge, strike critically, and survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath &amp; Bloodline Legacy</strong><br>Fallen heroes are lost forever; survivors enrich your lineage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Combat Mechanics &amp; Stat Effects</strong><br>Poison, burn, bleed resistance, dodge, evade \u2014 all in play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Unique Regions, Dozens of Enemy Types</strong><br>Survive across distinct biomes filled with thematic threats.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613280?t=1756928736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/38cd9e57940787bb7ea71cd7a911c470a4f8bece/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756928736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756928736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/34d77aa3a65ff27a20f5e0bb76d70593ca32b366/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756928736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed your heroes. Build your legacy. Face the end of the world. Again and again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/2bae36b3c381ec23000f9dfc6c15281c.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen, and only a few <strong>Seeds of Life</strong> remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this roguelike card and board game adventure, each run begins with the birth of a new hero. Use your limited breeding rights to select two parents, combine their traits, and bring a new warrior into the world. Your hero\u2019s stats, gender, and genetic quirks are shaped by lineage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/8b7407a127e48e818ef2e411aa8d3ef5.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genetics matter but nothing beats good preparation.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings in your village like the <strong>Barracks</strong>, <strong>Tavern</strong>, <strong>Gold Mine</strong>, or <strong>Ink Mine</strong> to unlock unique backgrounds for your newborns. Growing up near a certain building grants them stat bonuses from the very beginning.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/ffb1956bdf2cf026d5927d0e524fe7ab.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero embarks on a dangerous journey across eight distinct regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every region features a unique atmosphere, enemies, and a randomly generated board based on a set number of turns. Roll the dice to move across tiles, encountering traps, treasure, events, and enemies as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The path is full of thorns.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face strange encounters, survive odd events, and fight bizarre creatures. You can return to the village with your loot and preserve your bloodline or risk another turn for greater rewards.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/090b2e80a9b653c58ae13dc80066a97f.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true hero knows when to retreat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you return home before dying, your hero is added to the ancestral pool. That means your next child might be their child\u2026 or grandchild. And every generation is born a little stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.poster.avif?t=1756928736\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.webm?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/extras/e7c48a214dab9ace1a76e6f7b6b63e13.mp4?t=1756928736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolve your legacy across generations, and inch closer to victory with every run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strengthen your bloodline and reach the ancient power waiting at the world\u2019s edge?Or will your Seeds of Life run out\u00a0 one by one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Dark Fantasy World</strong><br>An atmospheric 2D universe crafted with detailed, hand-painted visuals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloodline-Based Hero Creation</strong><br>Merge ancestors, pass on traits, and create stronger heroes with each generation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Village &amp; Building System</strong><br>Construct structures like Barracks, Tavern, and Mines to grant unique backgrounds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice-Based Exploration</strong><br>Progress through a randomly generated board each turn by rolling dice.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Card Combat</strong><br>Play tactical cards, dodge, strike critically, and survive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath &amp; Bloodline Legacy</strong><br>Fallen heroes are lost forever; survivors enrich your lineage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Combat Mechanics &amp; Stat Effects</strong><br>Poison, burn, bleed resistance, dodge, evade \u2014 all in play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Unique Regions, Dozens of Enemy Types</strong><br>Survive across distinct biomes filled with thematic threats.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bozz"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/d9e017779e8727a37d6cbb8ca3e798e96b1ba51c/header.jpg?t=1756928736","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192771,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192771/movie480.mp4?t=1756928733","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192771/movie_max.mp4?t=1756928733"},"name":"Boardlike Whislist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192771/ce5c67e4a733212c1348c6102217d21e14b5374c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756928733","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192771/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756928733","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192771/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756928733"}}],"name":"Boardlike","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><