{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/f1db89b5b8f9c06c8c496ad101cd557691e298ab/ss_f1db89b5b8f9c06c8c496ad101cd557691e298ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756928736","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/f1db89b5b8f9c06c8c496ad101cd557691e298ab/ss_f1db89b5b8f9c06c8c496ad101cd557691e298ab.600x338.jpg?t=1756928736"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/e8a3ff9cf20e1ed36095005c0afb215999772836/ss_e8a3ff9cf20e1ed36095005c0afb215999772836.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756928736","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/e8a3ff9cf20e1ed36095005c0afb215999772836/ss_e8a3ff9cf20e1ed36095005c0afb215999772836.600x338.jpg?t=1756928736"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/a03814672d1f7dcfda64ca58ba8871644dbfc3aa/ss_a03814672d1f7dcfda64ca58ba8871644dbfc3aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756928736","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613280/a03814672d1f7dcfda64ca58ba8871644dbfc3aa/ss_a03814672d1f7dcfda64ca58ba8871644dbfc3aa.600x338.jpg?t=1756928736"}],"short_description":"The world has perished\u2026 Only a few Seeds of Life remain. Use ancient rituals to awaken them, combine the lineage of ancestors, and create a legendary hero. Cross eight deadly regions and reach the source of lost power. The last hope to be born\u2026 might just make you humanity\u2019s final chance.","steam_appid":3613280,"support_info":{"email":"info@bozz.works","url":"https://bozz.works/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Russian, Turkish","type":"game","website":null}